# gd-skills consistency-failures log
#
# Append-only record of mismatches found by /consistency-check.
# One entry per line:
#   <ISO8601 timestamp> | <severity> | <entity_id> | <file> | <message>
# severity ∈ { error, warn, info }
#
# Example (remove when you log real entries):
# 2026-06-03T12:00:00Z | error | goblin | scripts/enemies/goblin.gd | health=20 but registry says 30
